# Source

The vendored MC Dean design/UX subset, taken from two Owl-Listener repositories
at a pinned revision, both MIT. The entry point `skills/design-library/SKILL.md`,
`INDEX.md`, `EVALS.md` and this file are tezgah's own and are not part of the
manifest; the 39 `SKILL.md` below are.

- `inclusive-design-skills` -
  https://github.com/Owl-Listener/inclusive-design-skills at revision
  `6e0740f04b2130af60bc57abe3401b91e460e70d` (2026-06-09), MIT, Copyright (c)
  2026 MC Dean. Three of its plugins, every skill in them - the
  cognitive-accessibility, adaptive-interfaces and inclusive-interaction plugin
  directories, 30 skills in all.
- `designer-skills` - https://github.com/Owl-Listener/designer-skills at
  revision `9a6930cf84a822eb458624bd11c61aac5bbdf224` (2026-09-05), MIT,
  Copyright (c) 2026 MC Dean. Two of its plugins, part of them: the whole
  visual-critique plugin (7 skills) and two skills of design-research
  (`behavioural-analytics`, `qual-quant-triangulation`).

Checkout for a re-vendor:

```sh
git clone https://github.com/Owl-Listener/inclusive-design-skills
git -C inclusive-design-skills checkout 6e0740f04b2130af60bc57abe3401b91e460e70d
git clone https://github.com/Owl-Listener/designer-skills
git -C designer-skills checkout 9a6930cf84a822eb458624bd11c61aac5bbdf224
```

